    {
     "type": "box",
     "kind": "tip",
     "title": "Spot the tense",
     "items": [
      "**Maki-** verbs: **m** → **n** for the past and present (**n**aki-, **n**akiki-).",
      "**Paki-** verbs: add **-in-** after the p for the past and present (p**in**aki-, p**in**akiki-).",
      "The present and future repeat **ki**: naki**ki**-, maki**ki**-, pinaki**ki**-, paki**ki**-."
     ]
    },
